Journey: Add an employee through the UI and find the row in hs_hr_employee
Tags: @orangehrm @ui @db
Role: admin
Variables: first=Mira, last=Okafor${tag}, empId=${tag}1

Log in
Open /web/index.php/pim/addEmployee
Type "${first}" into the "First Name" field
Type "${last}" into the "Last Name" field
Clear the "Employee Id" field
Type "${empId}" into the "Employee Id" field
Upload "files/photo.png" to the "profile picture"
Watch for toasts
Click the "Save" button
Expect a toast containing "Successfully Saved"
Expect the URL contains "/pim/viewPersonalDetails/empNumber/"

Wait until query "SELECT emp_number FROM hs_hr_employee WHERE employee_id = '${empId}'" on hr returns 1 row within 15 seconds
Get the first row of query "SELECT emp_number, emp_firstname, emp_lastname, employee_id FROM hs_hr_employee WHERE employee_id = '${empId}'" on hr as emp
Expect ${emp.emp_firstname} equals "${first}"
Expect ${emp.emp_lastname} equals "${last}"
Get the value of query "SELECT LENGTH(epic_picture) AS bytes FROM hs_hr_emp_picture WHERE emp_number = ${emp.emp_number}" on hr as photoBytes
Expect ${photoBytes} > 1000

# Personal details: Vue oxd select dropdowns, a date input, radio buttons; two forms on the page have a Save button
Choose "Nigerian" in the Nationality select box
Choose "Married" in the "Marital Status" select box
Pick 1990-04-15 in the "Date of Birth" date picker
Check the "Female" radio button
Click the "Save" button in the "Personal Details" section
Expect a toast containing "Successfully Updated"
Wait until query "SELECT emp_number FROM hs_hr_employee WHERE emp_number = ${emp.emp_number} AND emp_birthday IS NOT NULL" on hr returns 1 row within 15 seconds
Get the first row of query "SELECT e.emp_birthday, e.emp_marital_status, e.emp_gender, n.name AS nationality FROM hs_hr_employee e LEFT JOIN ohrm_nationality n ON n.id = e.nation_code WHERE e.emp_number = ${emp.emp_number}" on hr as details
Expect ${details.emp_birthday} equals "1990-04-15"
Expect ${details.emp_marital_status} equals "Married"
Expect ${details.emp_gender} equals 2
Expect ${details.nationality} equals "Nigerian"
